>>A quick question to all you hack-gods: Does getting interruptted while
>>eating alter your chances of getting an intrinsic from the corpse (or a
>>tin)? Does it matter if you do something else, or eat something else, before
>>finishing? Or are intrinsics checked only when finishing the corpse?
>>
>>-Ian
